# SPEC-02 — Color and grading

Contract: `docs/spec-references/SPEC-02-color-grading.md`. Inherits SPEC-00. Do not build from it until the user feeds this spec.

Desktop is the flagship. Grades are non-destructive clip effects burned in at export. Where the code range is coarser than the spec, that is a range change, not a new control. Do not add a slider that maps to a few buckets.
